<section class="seo-help-head"><span class="eyebrow">SEO &amp; INTEGRATIONS · BEGINNER GUIDE</span><h1>Setup Help</h1><p>Choose the guide for the exact field you are configuring. Each tutorial tells you where to go, what to click, what to copy, where to paste it, and how to verify the result.</p><a href="{{ route('admin.settings.seo') }}"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Back to SEO settings</a></section>
